  "doc": "Quest 1's art by id (CastView, StageView, FxView ask for an id, never a path), so an art lane can swap a file here without touching the scenes; an id that is missing or fails to load draws a flat ink square and logs once. size_m: the drawn size in metres where the art fixes it (the rig captures); rows without it are drawn into the size the view's layout gives. draw_k: a factor on size_m (rivet / rivet_peek: the captures are of the night rig at size_k 1.3, the owner's base form is size_k 1.1 (d5-cast, 2026-11-03), so 1.1 / 1.3 until re-captured; then set the new capture, its size_m, and draw_k 1).",
